 "title": "Country Balls World War",
 "english_title": "Country Balls World War",
 "intro": "Country Balls World War is a strategic war game where you pick a country and battle it out with your neighbors to take control of the entire globe! Upgrade your countries to perform better, and become number one!",
 "description": "<h3>How to play Country Balls World War</h3>\n<p>Time to battle it out! In this strategy game, just your own land isn't good enough for you; you need the whole world in your possession! Luckily, you have a team of strong Country Balls to help you out with this. Pick a country you like to start in, fight with your neighbors, and capture their territory as well as their treasure! Spend this newfound treasure on upgrading your states or boosting the economy and earning even more.</p>\n<p>You can determine your own fighting style! Will you rush head-first into battle, or be tactical and max out your states and defenses near the border first? The choice is up to you! Be wise, use your logic and win the fight. Time to rule the world!</p>",
 "controls": "Click/tap and drag the country balls across the screen to attack!",
